    "display_name": "AI Chat ",
    "long_instructions": "##AI Brand Kit Helper\r\n\r\nUpload an image of your brand kit and ask 1–2 **focused questions** about accessibility, inclusivity, or clarity.\r\n- This might include a question about color contrast, readability, or how your design might be interpreted by different audiences.\r\n\r\nAfter reviewing the AI’s feedback, **decide which suggestions (if any) improve your design**. Then go back to your brand kit to refine and finish your design.\r\n",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Use AI as a design partner to brainstorm ideas, test audience fit, or check accessibility before finalizing your brand kit.",
